          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe, ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli, pamo ni ŵakutaga mbopesi, Alefi, acilonda ŵa ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE, ŵakwimba nyimbo ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE ni ŵakutumicila ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE, ni ŵane wosope ŵalilekangenye acimsyene kwa ŵandu ŵa cilendo ŵakutama mcilambo cetu pakulipikanila Lilamusi lya Mlungu, aciŵamkwetu ni ŵanace ŵetu sambano tukutenda cilanga mwakulumbila kuti tucigapikanila Malamusi ga AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tukulumbikana ni acalongo acimjetu, ni kutenda cilanga mwakulumbila kuti tucigapikanila Malamusi gosope gele wawo giŵapelece kupitila kwa Mose",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwakutumicila jwa Mlungu. Tucipikanila ni kutenda yosope yigakuŵeceta Malamusi ga Mlungu. Naga tukuleka kutenda yeleyi atulwesye uwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
