          "text": "Jwakutaga mbopesi jwa mwiŵasa lya Aloni akwenela kuŵa pamo ni Alefiwo, pa ndaŵi jele Alefiwo pitapoceleje yindu yine mwa yindu likumiyo. Kaneko Alefi ajigaleje cindu cimo mwa yindu likumiyo ajawuleje nayo ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE jwetu, ku yipinda yakusunjilamo katundu.",
